@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-4: Execution Plan Generation and Task Assignment (WF-09, WF-10)
|System|
start
if (Baseline requirements and timeline approved?) then (no)
  :Refuse generation;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|AI Supervisor|
:Divide project into phases with objectives,\ndates, deliverables, completion criteria;
if (Methodology is Agile/Scrum?) then (yes)
  :Divide phases into sprints\nand recommend sprint durations;
else (Kanban or Waterfall)
  :Use corresponding planning structure\n(no sprints);
endif
:Generate tasks with priority, estimated effort,\ndependencies, dates and completion criteria;
|System|
:Validate plan: mandatory fields, no dependency cycle,\ndates within phase and timeline;
if (Plan valid?) then (no)
  |AI Supervisor|
  :Retry once with corrective instruction;
  |System|
  if (Valid after retry?) then (no)
    :Show error and log failed attempt\n(nothing stored);
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
else (yes)
endif
:Store phases, sprints and tasks with relationships;
|Team Leader|
:Review project structure and modify\ntasks, priorities and deadlines;
|AI Supervisor|
:Recommend assignee per task using skills,\nworkload, complexity and availability;
|System|
:Store recommendations with rationale;
|Team Leader|
:Review recommendations;
if (Accept, modify or assign manually?) then (decide)
  |System|
  :Record each assignment with its source;
endif
|System|
:Assign untouched tasks to AI-recommended assignee\n(individual project: all tasks to the student);
:Notify assignees;
stop
@enduml
